<title>POLAND: FARMFOOD OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>FARMFOOD OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.19 vs   1.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.84 vs   1.25</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.44 vs   1.92</p>
<p> Sales		   19.02 vs  15.63</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.44 vs  10.43</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	12.15 vs  10.43</p>
<p> Operating profit    18.32 vs  15.54</p>
<p> Sales		  168.62 vs 126.57</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food maker is FarmFood SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
